{REASON:xdeeptree}
Propose 3-5 strong candidates for {{side-to-move}}.

GROUNDED ANALYSIS:
{{analysis}}

EXCLUDED MOVES:
{{excluded-moves}}{{#if wrong-move}}

ENGINE-REJECTED MOVES:
{{wrong-move}}
These moves must not appear among the candidates.{{/if}}{{#if classic}}

FEN: {{fen}}

ASCII BOARD:
{{ascii}}{{#if last-move}}

LAST MOVE: {{last-move}}{{/if}}{{else}}

VARIANT RULES:
{{chess-rules}}

CURRENT POSITION:
{{board-state}}{{#if last-move}}

LAST MOVE: {{last-move}}{{/if}}{{/if}}

{{#if classic}}The move field must contain canonical SAN, including required capture, disambiguation, promotion, and check/checkmate suffixes.{{/if}}{{#if output-uci}}The move field must contain canonical UCI: source followed by destination and a lowercase promotion suffix when required.{{/if}}{{#if output-numeric-json}}The move field must be a JSON object with exactly from, to, promotion: {"from":[x,y],"to":[x,y],"promotion":null}. Coordinates are absolute integers; promotion is null or the exact promoted piece name from the legend.{{/if}}{{#if output-semantic}}The move field must be '<Color> <PieceName> <from>-<to>'. Use x for captures, =<PromotionPiece> for promotion, and the exact special-move suffix when required.{{/if}}{{#if output-numeric}}The move field must be '<Color> <PieceName>: (x,y) -> (x,y)'. Use x for captures, append promotion and the exact special-move suffix when required.{{/if}}
{{#if numeric-coordinates}}The from and to fields must be absolute 1-based integer arrays [x,y], never mirrored.{{else}}The from and to fields must be absolute algebraic square strings.{{/if}}
